SDL-E1003 (spec/README.md#design-rules-settled)

  x unknown clause `raw` in user definition
   ,----
 1 | user u { on: root; raw: 1; };
   :                    ^|^
   :                     `-- unknown clause key
   `----
  help: `raw { … };` is a top-level statement — `raw` is reserved in block context and is not a clause of this block
